{"about_the_game":"Domynyo is a multiplayer online game based on a variety of playable modalities.<br>We aim to present a realistic graphics and fascinating gameplay based on fictional and visionary (fully customizable) vehicles, items, accessories and weapons.<br><br>Let\u2019s talk about the game! Domynyo is playable both in First Person and Third Person, depending on players preferences. Domynyo is NOT a pay to win. The player will be able to purchase in-game content but that won\u2019t give any sort of advantages, it will just make your character look more pretty (if you have good taste)!<br><br><strong>MAIN THEMES AND LOOK?</strong><br><br>Post-apocalyptic and Abandoned<br>environments are the protagonists of the First Season.<br>Dark environments, debris, creepy locations in a 4k world.<br><br>We thought dynamic lightning and weather is a must! The day-night cycle and climate conditions will influence the game to the point that you could find yourself in the dark seeking for a torch and praying for the storm to end (while trying not to get shot)!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1386720?t=1768587639","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1386720?t=1768587639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768587639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768587639","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround So